#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Deterministic, non-destructive MissionaryX local development readiness.

Default mode verifies static local assets only.  ``--live`` additionally uses
the existing MissionaryX llama.cpp adapter against an already-running
loopback server.  This tool never starts, stops, signals, or replaces a model
server and never contacts a package index or cloud service.
"""

